  "body": "This PR replaces #1760. GitHub closed #1760 when its base PR #1745 merged with `--delete-branch` before #1760 was retargeted. The branch is the same. It now has a merge of `upstream/main`.\n\nWhat changed\n- Slot Geometry tab: A X, A Y, B X and B Y are in their own \"Manual\" group. Slot width and the extension rows stay outside it.\n- New file `crates/ui/src/slot_manual_viz.rs`: it gives the A cross, the B cross and the A-B line. It reads the page draft, so the marks follow each edit before Apply. This is ephemeral UI state. The committed edit is still the undoable params edit.\n- The marks show only with no picked selection, with the Geometry tab open, and with the Properties pane visible for the same operation.\n- The posted G-code does not change.\n\nMerge resolution\n- `crates/ui/src/egui_app/shell.rs`: main now keeps CRLF line ends in this file. The old branch had changed them to LF. The merge takes main's text and applies the two #1732 hunks again (`state.properties_shown`, and the mark loop in `viewport_panel`). The diff against main is only these hunks.\n- `crates/ui/src/state.rs`: both sides added a field. Both fields are kept (`properties_shown`, `geo_row_marked`).\n\nReview findings of #1760\n1. Marks must hide when Properties does not show this operation (tool or setup page, closed or hidden pane): FIXED in 8c17efb95. Pinned by `no_marks_after_switching_to_a_tool_or_setup_page`, `no_marks_when_properties_is_closed_or_hidden` and `shell_updates_slot_marks_when_properties_is_hidden_and_closed`.\n2. Before and after screenshots: DONE. They are in the \"Screenshots\" section below. They were rendered under `xvfb-run -a` with the egui_kittest `render()` call, in a temporary test. The test is not committed, and no snapshot golden changed.\n\nScreenshots\n\nThese existing rendered captures are stored only on the fork's images-only `pr-screenshots` branch, at commit `fddb41b69238be94f03d1e4514cddc5409583262`.\n\nBefore: the A and B rows are outside a group. The viewport shows no A-B line.\n\n<img width=\"620\" height=\"1400\" alt=\"before_page\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/fddb41b69238be94f03d1e4514cddc5409583262/2034/before-manual.png\" />\n<img width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" alt=\"before_shell\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/fddb41b69238be94f03d1e4514cddc5409583262/2034/before-viewport.png\" />\n\nAfter: the A and B rows are in the \"Manual\" section. The draft A is (-12, 6) and is not applied. The purple A-B line follows the draft. The viewport has no scene, because the test viewport texture is empty.\n\n<img width=\"620\" height=\"1400\" alt=\"after_page\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/fddb41b69238be94f03d1e4514cddc5409583262/2034/after-manual.png\" />\n<img width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" alt=\"after_shell\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/fddb41b69238be94f03d1e4514cddc5409583262/2034/after-viewport.png\" />\n\nPinning tests (crates/ui, `egui_app::slot_manual_tests`)\n- `the_hand_typed_ends_sit_in_a_manual_section`\n- `the_marks_follow_a_draft_edit_before_it_is_committed`\n- `no_marks_with_a_selection_or_off_the_geometry_tab`\n- `no_marks_after_switching_to_a_tool_or_setup_page`\n- `no_marks_when_properties_is_closed_or_hidden`\n- `shell_updates_slot_marks_when_properties_is_hidden_and_closed`\n\nGate results previously recorded on reviewed head `07044a4fe17bd74d8934b9dea06b53c6cc849a7a` (the new fix is verified separately in the re-review comment)\n- `xvfb-run -a cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main`: green, 0 failed. This includes `headless_run_succeeds` and `headless_cli_exit_code_is_zero`, which now pass.\n- `cargo clippy -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -- -D warnings`: clean.\n\nNot exercised: no test pins the paint call in `shell.rs`; the tests pin the mark geometry and the dock transitions. The review note says `shell.rs` is over 1000 lines. A later change can move the overlay drawing to its own module (follow-up, not filed).\n\nChangelog: Slot: manual A/B fields in a \"Manual\" section; A/B points and line show in the viewport while edited\nEffort: medium\nProcess change: no\n\nFixes #1732\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\n",
